<title>CROATIA: Croatia's electricity board 1996 net falls 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia's electricity board 1996 net falls 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of kuna unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   52.45    vs	53.35</p>
<p>    Total income    5,423.54    vs   5,049.65</p>
<p>    Total expenses  5,388.25    vs   4,999.96</p>
<p>Note - State-owned electricity board Hrvatska Elektroprivreda (HEP) gave restated figures for 1995. HEP gave the same figure for profit before and after tax. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
